Doesn`t it seem like Nethack can`t take a loss? My level 30 rogue was on
dungeon level 49, when I ran into a nurse. After the nurse teleported, she 
probably stepped on a sleeping trap, because she didn`t attack me. When I
tried to chat with her, the game throws in a segmentation fault. Someone
posted an article previously about this bug; I should have listened.
Nethack is such a sore loser. If it is going to throw a low blow like that,
it should at least write to the score file "killed by Nethack bug."


